      "content": "it doesnt feel like i'm just overwhelmed though. it feels like i'm actually a problem. like, if i wasn't here, my partner wouldn't have to worry about the bills or the constant stress or how much i'm struggling. everything would just be... lighter. i'm just a constant drain on their energy.",
