    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you're saying that but it's hard to see it that way when i look at them. they're always so tired because of me. if i could just stop being such a massive, constant drain on their lives, maybe they'd actually get a chance to breathe and be happy. i just want things to be better for them, even if that means things are different for me.",
